Package: FDRcode
Title: Publication Code for Transcriptomics False-Positive Monte Carlo Analyses
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(person("Matt", "Meier", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Reusable scripts and compact derived data for the transcriptomics
    false-positive rate publication analyses. Includes frozen Monte Carlo trial
    assignments and functions for rebuilding the publication figures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
